    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Line 1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:NorGrith">Nor. Cyricgrið</ref> Line 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And on Norðhymbra lage is sanctus Petrus cyricfrið and sanctus Wilfriðus and sanctus lohannes binnan cyricwagum þreo hundred æt cwicum men, and æt dædum botleas.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And according to the law of the Northumbrians, the compensation owed for a violation of Church sanctuary at Saint Peter’s, Saint Wilfrid’s, and within the walls of Saint John’s is three hundred if the victim is alive, but it cannot be compensated for if he is dead.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[1] 7 on Norðhymbra lage is sanctus Petrus</ab>
      </div>
